00:25:03.960 --> 00:25:07.521
There might be details about maybe
a bullet point in your resume,

00:25:07.521 --> 00:25:11.353
some of that contextual situational,
kind of those ripple effects.

00:25:11.353 --> 00:25:14.037
That you might want to include
in your impact questions or

00:25:14.037 --> 00:25:15.970
somewhere in your essay.

00:25:15.970 --> 00:25:18.484
Or maybe there is something you
refer to in your essay, but

00:25:18.484 --> 00:25:19.780
more in that personal sense.

00:25:20.870 --> 00:25:24.090
But there's also impacts and
repercussions of it.

00:25:24.090 --> 00:25:28.120
Maybe that's where you add additional
detail in the impact side.

00:25:28.120 --> 00:25:32.575
So really thinking beyond just one part of
the application to really understand like,

00:25:32.575 --> 00:25:35.565
hey, these are different ways
