00:29:20.990 --> 00:29:24.926
If you have done it in the context
of the GSB application,

00:29:24.926 --> 00:29:27.940
try it with a different topic.

00:29:27.940 --> 00:29:30.820
But what we're going to do is
I'm going to ask you a question.

00:29:30.820 --> 00:29:33.080
I'm going to turn my camera off.

00:29:33.080 --> 00:29:36.386
So if you want to grab pen and
paper, so you can jot something down,

00:29:36.386 --> 00:29:40.356
open up another browser or just think
along, I'm going to turn my camera off, so

00:29:40.356 --> 00:29:42.240
that I don't distract you too much.

00:29:42.240 --> 00:29:44.770
I want you to be able
to get into that zone.

